+- **Texture data present before registration** (Japanese build): [CPU texture storage filled before registration](../../../docs/reference/nvn-objects.md#cpu-texture-storage-filled-before-registration).
 - **The MT Framework ARC and SPK readers** (`mtarc_members`, `mtspk_shaders`): [SPK shader package in an MT Framework ARC](../../../docs/reference/shaders.md#spk-shader-package-in-an-mt-framework-arc).
 - **SDK 10 calls found from the import list**, `nvnDeviceSetIntermediateShaderCache` and `nvnCommandBufferDiscardColor`: [services.md](../../../docs/reference/services.md), [NVN calls that were red stubs](../../../docs/reference/nvn-objects.md#nvn-calls-that-were-red-stubs).
+
+
+## Local Japanese Mac input presentation
+
+The Japanese 1.0.0/CN1.3 launcher now supports live keyboard/Switch/Xbox/PlayStation atlas selection, gated to title `0100D7F00FB1A000` and `DM_LIVE_ICONS`. It matches the entire original 512x512 BC7 payload, creates immutable resident alternatives, and refreshes texture view caches when host input ownership changes. The original Chinese font assets remain untouched. A single-process courtroom run verified all four styles and return transitions; actual Pro Controller discovery selected Switch. Physical hotplug and cursor behavior need hands-on acceptance. Other games and all chapters remain untested.
+
+Found on this game: [Connected controller still shows keyboard icons](../../../docs/reference/game-state.md#connected-controller-still-shows-keyboard-icons).
