@@ -304,6 +304,13 @@ Games read this count as a position in their own command memory and size their h
   - [FINAL FANTASY TACTICS - The Ivalice Chronicles](../../dm/games/010038B015560000/README.md): the UI reads its textures from `.tex` files the engine loads straight into a `CPU_UNCACHED | GPU_CACHED | COMPRESSIBLE` pool (flags 0xa2): 231 textures by the title screen, no packaged layout, no `WriteTexels`, no copies.
   - [The Great Ace Attorney Chronicles](../../dm/games/010036E00FB20000/README.md): a dialog box sampling 256x256 and 1024x256 textures of format 0x4d; `DM_NVN_TEXINFO=1024x256` showed storage that already held data at first use (226,555 of 262,144 bytes non-zero): no packaged layout, block-linear, in a 1000 MB `CPU_CACHED | GPU_CACHED | COMPRESSIBLE` pool (flags 0xa4). A log of the pool flushes, texture creations and file reads (temporary lines under `DM_NVN_LOG`) showed every `.tex` read into staging buffers (512 KB `ReadFile`s, none into the pool) and the texels copied by the CPU into the texture's storage; only the four linear 1024x64 text textures are flushed, every frame. `main` has no cache maintenance instruction at all.
 
+### CPU texture storage filled before registration
+
+- **Symptom:** large parts of a scene are black although their draws and shader geometry are present; `DM_NVN_TEXINFO` shows non-zero guest storage, while `DM_NVN_TEXRAW` shows all-zero Metal textures.
+- **Cause:** the game fills a CPU-visible memory pool before `nvnTextureInitialize`. `tex_dirty_upload` starts its page-protection clock at texture registration, so it cannot see the earlier write. With no packaged layout or later flush, the host creates an empty GPU-only texture.
+- **Fix:** when `tex_dirty_upload` is enabled, `ft_add` checks a newly registered CPU-visible sampled texture for initial non-zero storage. Such a texture is marked CPU-written immediately and uploaded from guest memory on first use. Empty storage still enters the existing dirty-page tracker for later writes.
+- **Found on:** [The Great Ace Attorney Chronicles](../../dm/games/010036E00FB20000/README.md), Japanese 1.0.0 build `0100D7F00FB1A000`: four 1024×1024 BC1 textures of the title room had 475,029–515,634 non-zero bytes at registration but all-zero Metal contents. The original and Chinese-patched title room both rendered completely after the fix.
+
 ### `ReadTexels` from guest memory and textures written after first use
 
 - **Symptom:** a texture the game builds from CPU-filled textures read back with `nvnTextureReadTexels` comes out zero.
diff --git a/docs/reference/rendering.md b/docs/reference/rendering.md
